  + no governed live operator key policy governance artifact revocation snapshot time witness fresh host observation private execution permit or broker projection has been supplied
  + a closed ceremony plan can make those absences and their causal order machine-verifiable without generating a key signing a decision reading a clock observing the host or invoking the broker
  + keeping plan compilation separate from ceremony performance prevents repository work fixture keys SJS signatures or a general continuation directive from being mistaken for operator consent

